flowchart LR
  Operator[Phone or serial operator] -->|manual command / mission intent| API[Command and status adapter]
  API --> Mission[Behavior policy core]

  ToF[Front range and side scan] --> Sensors[Validated sensor snapshot]
  IMU[IMU tilt estimate] --> Sensors
  Floor[Downward floor sensors] --> Sensors
  Bumper[Bumper input] --> Sensors
  Sensors --> Safety[Safety supervisor]
  Safety -->|fresh, plausible readings| Mission
  Safety -->|hazard, stale data, emergency| Stop[Latched stop]

  Mission -->|short, interruptible action| Adapter[Board and gait adapter]
  Stop -->|stop request| Adapter
  Adapter --> ServoPWM[PWM driver]
  ServoPWM --> Servos[Eight leg servos]
  Mission --> OLED[OLED face and status]

  Battery[Protected battery and fuse] --> Regulator[Separate rated servo rail]
  Regulator --> ServoPWM
  Battery --> Logic[Regulated logic rail]
  Logic --> MCU[ESP32-S3 class controller]
  MCU --- API
  MCU --- Sensors
  MCU --- Safety
  MCU --- Adapter

